    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover Insignia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accompany a young apprentice, Armin, on the swashbuckling adventure of a lifetime to discover the fate of his lost father, learn the magical arts of blacksmithing, and rise to meet a destructive force threatening the kingdom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/f5aaaacbb54eed5c677939d07ef73e17.poster.avif?t=1745648919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/f5aaaacbb54eed5c677939d07ef73e17.webm?t=1745648919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/f5aaaacbb54eed5c677939d07ef73e17.mp4?t=1745648919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Action Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leap through vividly hand-crafted mountains, forests, deserts and shores in this pixel art action platformer. Face against tricky foes in a unique combat system that rewards quick thinking with colourfully acrobatic action abilities. Leap, roll, slash and parry to capture enemy powers and use them to your advantage in combat and traversal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/2bb6797baf8b99a057a32488a64ee82e.poster.avif?t=1745648919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/2bb6797baf8b99a057a32488a64ee82e.webm?t=1745648919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/2bb6797baf8b99a057a32488a64ee82e.mp4?t=1745648919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Sweeping Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter a cast of charming characters in a world with rich lore and intrigue as your path crosses with theirs. The tale of Insignia takes place in a fantasy world where humans are just one of many races of animals with language, history and culture. When the threat of war is on the horizon, can fingers and claws come together or are they destined to tear each other apart?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/0688ca2365cb0c9b46ab54fd541eaceb.poster.avif?t=1745648919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/0688ca2365cb0c9b46ab54fd541eaceb.webm?t=1745648919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/0688ca2365cb0c9b46ab54fd541eaceb.mp4?t=1745648919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Curious Crafting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master your crafting skills to forge new items and abilities, unlocking secrets and opening new paths through the world. Discover forgotten Crucibles in the far corners of the kingdom to upgrade your sword's capabilities. It is said that in the beginning the unseen ones wrought nature with mere words. Could learning their language reveal the power to reforge nature itself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/944ff754359eeb854f52d7fd5021109f.poster.avif?t=1745648919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/944ff754359eeb854f52d7fd5021109f.webm?t=1745648919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/944ff754359eeb854f52d7fd5021109f.mp4?t=1745648919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dark Dungeons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delve into vast and challenging dungeons with tricky puzzles, treacherous foes and spectacular boss fights. Put everything you\u2019ve learned to the test and claim the pieces of Insignia before they fall into the hands of the enemy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/1ea51e0a7f9e38ee2ab66b2b32310932.poster.avif?t=1745648919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/1ea51e0a7f9e38ee2ab66b2b32310932.webm?t=1745648919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/1ea51e0a7f9e38ee2ab66b2b32310932.mp4?t=1745648919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover Insignia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accompany a young apprentice, Armin, on the swashbuckling adventure of a lifetime to discover the fate of his lost father, learn the magical arts of blacksmithing, and rise to meet a destructive force threatening the kingdom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/f5aaaacbb54eed5c677939d07ef73e17.poster.avif?t=1745648919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/f5aaaacbb54eed5c677939d07ef73e17.webm?t=1745648919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/f5aaaacbb54eed5c677939d07ef73e17.mp4?t=1745648919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Action Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leap through vividly hand-crafted mountains, forests, deserts and shores in this pixel art action platformer. Face against tricky foes in a unique combat system that rewards quick thinking with colourfully acrobatic action abilities. Leap, roll, slash and parry to capture enemy powers and use them to your advantage in combat and traversal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/2bb6797baf8b99a057a32488a64ee82e.poster.avif?t=1745648919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/2bb6797baf8b99a057a32488a64ee82e.webm?t=1745648919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/2bb6797baf8b99a057a32488a64ee82e.mp4?t=1745648919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Sweeping Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter a cast of charming characters in a world with rich lore and intrigue as your path crosses with theirs. The tale of Insignia takes place in a fantasy world where humans are just one of many races of animals with language, history and culture. When the threat of war is on the horizon, can fingers and claws come together or are they destined to tear each other apart?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/0688ca2365cb0c9b46ab54fd541eaceb.poster.avif?t=1745648919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/0688ca2365cb0c9b46ab54fd541eaceb.webm?t=1745648919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/0688ca2365cb0c9b46ab54fd541eaceb.mp4?t=1745648919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Curious Crafting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master your crafting skills to forge new items and abilities, unlocking secrets and opening new paths through the world. Discover forgotten Crucibles in the far corners of the kingdom to upgrade your sword's capabilities. It is said that in the beginning the unseen ones wrought nature with mere words. Could learning their language reveal the power to reforge nature itself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/944ff754359eeb854f52d7fd5021109f.poster.avif?t=1745648919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/944ff754359eeb854f52d7fd5021109f.webm?t=1745648919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/944ff754359eeb854f52d7fd5021109f.mp4?t=1745648919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dark Dungeons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delve into vast and challenging dungeons with tricky puzzles, treacherous foes and spectacular boss fights. Put everything you\u2019ve learned to the test and claim the pieces of Insignia before they fall into the hands of the enemy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/1ea51e0a7f9e38ee2ab66b2b32310932.poster.avif?t=1745648919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/1ea51e0a7f9e38ee2ab66b2b32310932.webm?t=1745648919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127370/extras/1ea51e0a7f9e38ee2ab66b2b32310932.mp4?t=1745648919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
